  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "Dayforce (legal/brand shift from Ceridian in 2024) is a single-application HCM for HR, payroll, time, talent, planning, and analytics. The product thesis is continuous calculation: pay impacts update as timecards change rather than a week-end batch. First-party pricing is quote-led with no published PEPM or free plan. Gartner Cloud HCM Leader (vendor-cited, 2025). Landscape enterprise HCM — not an SMB payroll peer.",
